triggered). Desk backtest for S4: edge (+0.23R over 681 trades). Holmes strength sequence S8 (potential professional buying → basic test → no supply / test) completed 1 Oct: potential professional buying 11 Sep → test 24 Sep → no supply / test 1 Oct. It confirms on a trade above 143.67; a close below 138.17 proves it wrong (triggered). Desk backtest for S8: noise (+0.06R over 1067 trades)."},"scores":{"overall":15,"group":"SIC 372x (Transportation Equipment)","group_rank":18,"group_n":20,"sector_rank":489,"sector_n":518,"earn":32}},"biz":{"name":"AeroVironment Inc","desc":"AeroVironment, Inc., a defense technology provider, designs, develops, produces, delivers, and supports a portfolio of robotic systems and related services for government agencies and businesses in the United States and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Autonomous Systems; and Space, Cyber and Directed Energy. The company provides uncrewed aircraft systems (UAS), which include small and medium UAS, and kinesis command and control software; and counter-UAS and precision strike, a loitering munitions solution that deliver actionable intelligence and precision firepower modern warfighters, including precision strike, radio frequency and kinetic C-UAS, and electronic warfare systems. It also offers autonomy, AI, and platform technologies; unmanned maritime; and uncrewed ground systems. The company provides digital beamforming technology, a multi-band/beam software defined antenna tile that allows simultaneous communication with multiple satellites; laser communications, a data transmission systems for space operations; space-qualified hardware for line of sight stabilization and control electronics in low, medium, and geostationary earth orbit, as well as cislunar orbits; phased array antenna technology to supports hypersonic telemetry and tracking, and other missile testing; and directed energy solution. It also offers cyber solutions for national security and defense operations. AeroVironment, Inc. was incorporated in 1971 and is headquartered in Arlington, Virginia.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"3721","sic_desc":"Aircraft","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","mcap":7156572160,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"ARLINGTON, VA","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"0430","cik":1368622,"state_inc":"DE","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-09"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2023-10-28","rev":180816000.0,"rev_yoy":62.0,"eps":0.66,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":17840000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":9.9,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-01-27","rev":186578000.0,"rev_yoy":38.8,"eps":0.5,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":13885000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":7.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-04-30","rev":196979000.0,"rev_yoy":5.9,"eps":0.2,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":6046000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":3.1,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-07-27","rev":189483000.0,"rev_yoy":24.4,"eps":0.75,"eps_yoy":-10.7,"ni":21166000.0,"ni_yoy":-3.3,"nm":11.2,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-10-26","rev":188458000.0,"rev_yoy":4.2,"eps":0.27,"eps_yoy":-59.1,"ni":7543000.0,"ni_yoy":-57.7,"nm":4.0,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-01-25","rev":167636000.0,"rev_yoy":-10.2,"eps":-0.06,"eps_yoy":-112.0,"ni":-1754000.0,"ni_yoy":-112.6,"nm":-1.0,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-04-30","rev":275050000.0,"rev_yoy":39.6,"eps":0.59,"eps_yoy":195.0,"ni":16664000.0,"ni_yoy":175.6,"nm":6.1,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2025-08-02","rev":454676000.0,"rev_yoy":140.0,"eps":-1.44,"eps_yoy":-292.0,"ni":-67370000.0,"ni_yoy":-418.3,"nm":-14.8,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-11-01","rev":472508000.0,"rev_yoy":150.7,"eps":-0.34,"eps_yoy":-225.9,"ni":-17103000.0,"ni_yoy":-326.7,"nm":-3.6,"derived":null,"fp":nu